      {
        "id": 230771,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-05-22T19:30:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If your scene has multiple locations they are limited to what's in their current location. &nbsp;Otherwise, it's up to the discretion of the GM and what the player can convince the GM they should be able to hit based off the power and quality used. &nbsp;</p>",
